    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that makes sense. So basically, the value just drops by that same amount every single year regardless of how much we actually use the machine? Is there a specific reason why we use this method instead of something more realistic that accounts for more wear and tear in the early years?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
